  "caveats": [
    "Historical normal boot is not proof of a future fastboot entry state.",
    "GZ historical mode0x3c5 is EL1h; generic selected ATF source can chooseEL2, so entry must measure CurrentEL.",
    "Watchdog length is30seconds; IRQ/dual-stage/reset routing means this is not a proved exact reset deadline.",
    "Static512MiB DT memory/reg is not actual6GiB runtime map; preserve all runtime reservations.",
    "No lab-fixture/native peripheral ownership is established by this evidence."
